🚑 Jordan De Goey (AF $862k SC $430k M/F)

@CollingwoodFC update: "De Goey had glute soreness following Thursday’s game against Geelong. His availability for Round 22 will be assessed following main training on Thursday."

#AFLFantasy #SuperCoach #AFL

❌ Nic Newman (AF $839k SC $384k DEF)

@CarltonFC update: "Commenced his rehabilitation, with the Club to provide a further update on his progress when he returns to training.”

Listed as 6-7 weeks #AFLFantasy #SuperCoach

👀 Zak Butters (AF $993k SC $600k MID)

@PAFC update: "Butters began running on Monday in his return from a syndesmosis repair, with the midfielder pushing for a possible return late in the season."

Listed as 2-3 weeks #AFLFantasy #SuperCoach

❌ Wayne Milera (AF $926k SC $513k DEF)

@Adelaide_FC Executive Footy GM Adam Kelly: “Unfortunately, Wayne was not able to complete today’s session due to a hamstring injury, we will not know the extent of the injury until we see the results of a scan."

#AFLFantasy #SuperCoach

🤔 Darcy Cameron (AF $869k SC $475k RUC)

@CollingwoodFC coach Craig McRae: "Darcy has been managing his body for a couple of weeks now. The five-day break, the travel, he has been up against it a bit. Did what he needed to today."

#AFLFantasy #SuperCoach #AFL

❌ Nic Newman (AF $839k SC $384k DEF)

@CarltonFC update: "Sustained a hamstring injury in the first quarter of Saturday’s game, with scans revealing a hamstring strain. The Club will now work through his recovery timeline over the next fortnight."

#AFLFantasy #SuperCoach #AFL
